direction: scalar output -> const, generically
  stride_of::<W13, Cold>()  = 13
  stride_of::<W16, Cold>()  = 16
  stride_of::<W13, Warm>()  = 16

direction: type output -> const, generically
  W13/Cold  stride=13 carrier=16 access=32 align=2

direction: type output -> type, generically
  widen_one::<W13, Cold>(8191u16) -> u32 = 8191
  the same call at Warm returns u16, from the same source line:
  widen_one::<W13, Warm>(8191u16) -> u16 = 8191

p2 could write none of the last block. its output was a value, not a type.
